<title>USA: FSI gets $11 mln systems management order.</title>
<headline>FSI gets $11 mln systems management order.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSI International Inc said Friday it received an order valued at $11 million for its chemical management system from Hyundai Group affiliate Hyundai Semiconductor of America.</p>
<p>Shipping of the ChemFill 1500 Series Chemical Delivery Modules and Model 100 Chemical Blending Systems for use at Hyundai's new manufacturing plant in Eugene, Ore., is expected to begin during the first quarter of calendar 1997.</p>
<p>FSI manufactures capital equipment used by semiconductor manufacturers for processing silicon wafers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
